fix(interaction): prevent stuck Tab/Expanded regions after repeated gestures

Fix intermittent stuck states (chevron failing to deploy or expanded bar failing to collapse):
- In DockInteractionController.EnterRegion, call Reevaluate() when Tab is already in _regions under DockState.Tab with no pending timer instead of returning silently.
- In PointerRegionBehavior, check !IsMouseOver on Input-priority Dispatcher after Drop to clear drag-entered regions, and emit EnterCommand when a region becomes Visible while IsMouseOver is true.
- Add regression test in DockInteractionControllerTests (499/499 passing, Release build clean).

Refs: RF02, HU02 (CA #2, CA #3), E3-CA1, E3-CA2, E3-CA3